{"id":"37","name":"37_測試定義","mode":"table","title":"37_測試定義","notes":["一列＝一個測試定義的一個版本｜列數 6｜來源表：TestDefinition, TestDefinitionHistory, TestDefPoints, TestDefAsgms, ExtBlockTags","TestDefinition 只有 AMS 預設 3 筆(ID -3 Default Flow Verification、-2 Default External Lab、-1 Default Field Device)，沒有廠內自訂測試定義；TestDefinitionHistory/TestDefPointsHistory 各只有一版(EventIdDay 25569 = 1970-01-01，即安裝預設)。","校正週期單位 DefIntervalUnits 依 AmsSp_Operation_GetProjectedCalibrationDate_1 註解：0=none, 1=days, 2=weeks, 3=months, 4=years；三個預設定義 DefCalibrationInterval=3 但 Units=0(無) → 校正排程實際未啟用。","Type 代碼：99=Field Device(現場裝置校正，5 測試點 0/25/50/75/100%)、2=Flow Verification(3 點 0/50/100%)、5=External Lab；為 AMS Calibration Assistant 型別代碼(_modules 未列常數，依名稱與 TestDefPoints 對應)。","誤差限值欄位單位為 % 量程；Default Field Device 通知 0.6%/調整 0.4%/最大 0.5%。DefCalPowerSource 等 -1 表示不適用。","TestResults / TestResultAFAL / TestResultPoints 皆為空：本廠從未在 AMS 中登錄校正結果。","6 列(3 定義 × 現行/歷史)內容完全相同(歷史版=安裝預設)：DefCalibrationInterval 皆 3、CriticalService 皆 否、Span/Linearity 限值皆 0、DefUse* 皆 否、設置說明/收尾說明/校驗器材質 皆空字串；ExtBlockTags/TestDefAsgms 指派數只有 -1 Default Field Device 非 0(-2/-3 為 0；sentinel 位號 -1 另有一列指到 -2)。"],"header_cells":[{"r":1,"c":1,"v":{"t":"⌂ 目錄","l":{"s":"00","r":1}}}],"bands":[{"label":"校正測試定義(現行+歷史)含週期、誤差限值、測試點與指派數","from":0,"to":33,"bg":"#1F4E79","fc":"#FFFFFF"}],"columns":[{"label":"紀錄來源","fmt":null,"type":"text","w":224,"align":"left","bg":null},{"label":"測試定義ID (TestDefinitionId)","fmt":null,"type":"num","w":80,"align":"right","bg":null,"note":"TestDefinitionId","mono":true},{"label":"名稱 (Name)","fmt":null,"type":"text","w":216,"align":"left","bg":null,"note":"Name"},{"label":"測試類型 (Type)","fmt":null,"type":"text","w":224,"align":"left","bg":null,"note":"Type"},{"label":"校正週期 (DefCalibrationInterval)","fmt":null,"type":"num","w":80,"align":"right","bg":null,"note":"DefCalibrationInterval"},{"label":"週期單位 (DefIntervalUnits)","fmt":null,"type":"text","w":200,"align":"left","bg":null,"note":"DefIntervalUnits"},{"label":"關鍵服務 (CriticalServic